     2633   field slt-pc as decimal
     2634   field vat-base as decimal
     2635   field vat-rubl as decimal
     2636   field vat-doc as decimal
     2637   field sum-base as decimal
     2638   field sum-rubl as decimal
     2639   field sum-doc as decimal
     2640   field cash-desk  as integer
     2641   field is-petrol as logical
     2642   field cashbookId as int64
     2643   field is-expense_cash as logical
     2644   field num-expense_cash as int
