     3018       end.
     3019      for each temp-z-number
     3020      break
     3021      by temp-z-number.cash-desk
     3022      :
     3023        if first-of( temp-z-number.cash-desk) then do:
     3024           find first temp-z-number-list
     3025           where temp-z-number-list.cash-desk = temp-z-number.cash-desk no-error.
     3026          if not available temp-z-number-list then do:
